        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    Note over Referente,PostgreSQL: CU-08 - Registrar Paciente\n    participant Referente as Referente Psicosocial\n    participant Vue as Vue Frontend (Create.vue)\n    participant Controller as PacienteController\n    participant Middleware as Middleware / Policies\n    participant PostgreSQL\n\n    Referente-&gt;&gt;Vue: 1. Click &quot;Nuevo Paciente&quot;\n    Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 2. GET /pacientes/create\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Middleware: 3. Verificar rol (abort 403 si no)\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 4. Cargar facultades y carreras\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 5. Renderizar formulario\n    Referente-&gt;&gt;Vue: 6. Completar datos\n    Referente-&gt;&gt;Vue: 7. Click &quot;Guardar&quot;\n    Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 8. POST /pacientes\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Middleware: 9. Validar StorePacienteRequest\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 10. DB::transaction()\n    Note over Controller,PostgreSQL: INSERT pacientes&lt;br/&gt;(PHI cifrado con EncryptedFieldCast)&lt;br/&gt;INSERT contactos_paciente (cifrados)\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 11. COMMIT\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 12. Redirect 302 /dashboard\n    Vue--&gt;&gt;Referente: 13. Dashboard con paciente en lista&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="cu08-seq">
